 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how are things going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Just moved into my first flat. Which spices should I buy first? The shelf at the shop is overwhelming.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "block": "cooking.dlg28",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Start small. Black pepper, cumin, smoked paprika, chili flakes, dried oregano and cinnamon cover a lot of dishes.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cooking.dlg28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Cinnamon for savory stuff?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "block": "cooking.dlg28",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yes, a pinch in chili or a tagine is great. And of course for porridge.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cooking.dlg28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What about those big mixed jars, like curry powder?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.2,
   "block": "cooking.dlg28",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Curry powder and garam masala are handy shortcuts. Buy small jars, though, spices lose their flavor after a year or so.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cooking.dlg28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'll get the basics then. Is it worth buying",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 3.02,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "cooking.dlg28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "whole ones and grinding them?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.3,
   "block": "cooking.dlg28",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Eventually, maybe. For now, ground is perfectly fine.",
